flowchart LR
    HL[Hyperliquid public WebSocket]

    subgraph PaperContainer[Non-root read-only paper container]
        RAW[Raw-first recorder]
        PARSE[Strict BTC normalizer]
        STATE[Causal L2 and trade assembler]
        FEAT[Production feature engine]
        MTF[Closed-bar 15m / 5m / 1m structure]
        STRAT[Bounded smart-money scalper]
        RISK[Synchronous hard risk authority]
        SIM[Deterministic MBP paper exchange]
        LLM[Async shadow-only LLM observer]
        DRIFT[Run-frozen online drift monitor]
        WATCH[Stale and operator-kill watchdog]
    end

    subgraph Durable[Writable state and data volumes]
        ARCHIVE[(Immutable raw segments)]
        JOURNAL[(SQLite decisions, orders, fills, account, checkpoints)]
        KILL[Persistent operator kill]
        STATUS[Atomic health status]
    end

    HL --> RAW
    RAW -->|append, flush, fdatasync before callback| ARCHIVE
    RAW --> PARSE
    PARSE --> STATE
    STATE --> FEAT
    STATE --> MTF
    FEAT --> STRAT
    MTF --> STRAT
    FEAT --> DRIFT
    STRAT --> RISK
    RISK -->|single-use approval| SIM
    RISK -->|approved entry evidence only| LLM
    SIM --> JOURNAL
    DRIFT --> JOURNAL
    LLM --> JOURNAL
    KILL --> RISK
    WATCH --> RISK
    WATCH --> SIM
    WATCH --> STATUS

    PROM[Prometheus] --> GRAF[Grafana paper dashboard]
    FEAT --> PROM
    RISK --> PROM
    SIM --> PROM
    DRIFT --> PROM
    LLM --> PROM

    KEY[Exchange account or wallet]
    KEY -. forbidden by config, compose, and tests .-> PaperContainer

    OPENAI[OpenAI key file]
    OPENAI -->|read-only; no execution path| LLM

